steps.message:
The failing reproduction confirms the feature is absent. I’ll implement the core now with:

- a string-backed frequency enum on `User::Settings`;
- persisted `Notification::Bundle` windows that snapshot their frequency/deadline;
- a nullable `collecting` marker with a unique `(user_id, collecting)` index, plus user-row locking and overlap validation;
- bundle entries that snapshot each payload and retain a link to the source notification;
- one scheduled delivery job per newly opened window;
- an email push target registered alongside web push.

The entry join lets a coalesced in-app notification participate in successive digest windows without losing already-collected content.

